      "en": "The LORD reigns! He is clothed with majesty! The LORD is armed with strength. The world also is established. It can’t be moved.",
      "ko": "여호와께서 통치하시니 스스로 권위를 입으셨도다 여호와께서 능력을 입으시며 띠셨으므로 세계도 견고히 서서 요동치 아니하도다",
      "source_text_hash": "6708e79735551f354722a4fd2a05152db56d5301ead831b2483720bee365a83f",
      "translation_text_hash": "5a6d0cddbfb17c84428c9fe62d073d8f5f6a2c5f58a70479858d6877086ae28d",
