      "en": "Your throne is established from long ago. You are from everlasting.",
      "ko": "주의 보좌는 예로부터 견고히 섰으며 주는 영원부터 계셨나이다",
      "source_text_hash": "8ab6e75a7e95071d298c7790c92c579ae313c5f8c3106e0b207c5c3a7adf7ecb",
      "translation_text_hash": "1feb8d79fd65179120ce0bf06bd147d9857e64f676d4a9358c8cca1c9142ddd6",
